<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18796" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχροος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχρους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>colourless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				418b27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				236
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ocell.
				2.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				2.4.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ill-complexioned, pallid,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔχροος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>VC</u>
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				966b35
			</span></i>, al.: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχρούστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					2.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				584a14
			</span></i>: also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οώτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					2.63
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχροοι: πυρραὶ ἡμίονοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχροον: πονηρόν: Λάκωνες
				νόθον,</span> Id.</div>
